The client entrypoint is in the wrong place. `src/client` is mapped to `ReplicatedStorage.Client` in `default.project.json`, and scripts under ReplicatedStorage don't run on the client. Your `init.client.luau` would be a LocalScript that never starts.

It should go under `StarterPlayer.StarterPlayerScripts`, which runs once per player. Change the mapping in `default.project.json`:

```json
{
  "name": "arena",
  "tree": {
    "$className": "DataModel",
    "ReplicatedStorage": {
      "Shared": { "$path": "src/shared" },
      "Packages": { "$path": "Packages" }
    },
    "ServerScriptService": { "Server": { "$path": "src/server" } },
    "StarterPlayer": {
      "StarterPlayerScripts": {
        "Client": { "$path": "src/client" }
      }
    }
  }
}
```

Keep `src/client/init.client.luau` where it is. The server entrypoint in `src/server` is already in the right place under ServerScriptService.

I haven't edited the file. Say the word and I'll make the change. If you're using Studio Script Sync or a `sourcemap.json`, regenerate it after the change.
